    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87713" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προκατασκευ-άξω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>prepare beforehand,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἱρκτὰς ταῦτα π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					3.1.19
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				15.47
			</span></i> (codd.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νίκην</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρμακον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					60.34
				</span></i>
			; <i>fortify in advance,</i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσβολάς</span>] Aen. Tact.<i><span class="en">
				16.16
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τινὰ εὔλυτον</span>
			<i>put</i> him into a condition of free bowel-action, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
			</span></i> Trall.<i><span class="en">
				11.2
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φίλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					4.32.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Si.Prol.</u>
				26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.180
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Haem.</u>
				3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Col.</u>
				792b5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.21.3
			</span></i>. </div>
